messages ({(["id":147,"body":"
	To die, or not to die, that's the question

	For tomorrow is unknown, and time passing,

	As we watch the fire in gold evening.
	Stars no answer, and hearts froozen...

			Olive....Die bah...

		Living harder than Death...

	As Death tells me that, I nod from the heart...
